  tip Runecloth Gloves is orange at 234 (yellow 245, green 260, grey 275): about 43 crafts to 265, up to 50 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 4 Bolt of Runecloth, 4 Rugged Leather and 1 Rune Thread. Make the 172 Bolt of Runecloth first. Qia in Everlook keeps one pattern at a time; the Timbermaw Hold tunnel from Felwood is the road in, so never kill Timbermaw furbolgs on the way.
