  loop Silithus lvl 56 lap 700 yield 11.2 r 80 at 60.1,25.8 56.5,32.2 55.3,23.4 59.8,19.7 63.5,17.0 62.8,24.1 65.5,27.8 64.2,31.3
  loop Azshara lvl 53 lap 1029 yield 13.3 only Alliance r 80 at 58.0,20.4 59.7,17.9 56.7,17.4 54.9,15.7 47.9,19.7 47.7,23.8 49.9,24.6 51.0,28.6 52.6,33.0 53.1,25.6 55.3,22.4 58.0,23.4
  loop The Hinterlands lvl 50 lap 1029 yield 11.3 only Alliance r 80 at 82.1,52.7 82.7,48.2 82.5,43.5 82.5,39.0 75.6,48.7 74.9,55.2 80.0,58.0 78.9,61.3 77.3,64.9 79.8,65.8 84.8,63.8 83.8,57.8
